{"parse": {"title": "TTL-05", "pageid": 28153, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-04\" title=\"TTL-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTL-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-06\" title=\"TTL-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.BB.E8.A7.92.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"主角们\">主角们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 主角们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Protagonists</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770305</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋内的灯光昏黄，幽灵们的影子挤作一团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯挣扎着从床上坐起，信纸上历历在目的笔迹仍在刺痛着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这显然不会是混乱的终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边窸窸窣窣的声响愈演愈烈，将她从混乱的意识中唤醒，又落入另一场——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更大的混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>事情发生在这座岛上，我很遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>但我必须声明：这一场失败的主要原因，都需要归咎于马歇尔的部分——是他的部分拖累了整篇专栏！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>想想看，朋友们——！究竟有谁会想在美好的清晨或下午茶时间，在疲惫工作的间隙，阅读到这样一篇充满着谜团与不可知物的可怕文章呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他双手抱胸，对年轻人做出的仓促决定相当痛心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>我完全不认同你的指责，老杜卡特，你只是在逃避责任……是你的部分毁掉了一切！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>正如马库斯所说的，现在的时代，是一个进步的时代，是一个积极向上的时代。而你的故事恰恰相反，它完全背离了这个时代，有如一架脱轨的火车！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>老套的内容和任谁都能猜出来的情节发展，它们比我奶奶阁楼上积的灰还要多上几层——更谈不上半点真实！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>哼～不懂经典的家伙，快找根绳子把自己系系好吧——不然，我怀疑你那轻浮的审美也要飘到天上去了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杜卡特先生的面色通红，他的胡须高高地翘起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>你……你们不要再吵了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>呼……请冷静下来，马歇尔先生，杜卡特先生。我想你们应该听一听唐纳德先生的建议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>或许我不该说出真相……但、但谎言是更加可怕的魔鬼，所以我必须得说……你们两个讲述的回忆都存在严重的问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>杜卡特先生太、太过执着于表现自己了，为了这个目的，你夸大了其中的情节，曲解了其中的真实部分，甚至与马歇尔先生的内容相互矛盾……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>可马库斯小姐的故事应该讲述的是……弗兰南群岛的谜团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>相当有力的论证，唐纳德！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>你、你也是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>你的故事犯了另一个错误，马歇尔先生。你完全忽略了编辑的建议，你只顾自己的体验，完全不在乎读者的接受程度，甚、甚至没有给大家解开任何一个谜团……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>我可把知道的一切都说了！——没有半句虚话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>你在这儿呆了十二年，可你还是什么都不知道……你这该死的家伙，我以高出你十五年的阅历断言，你只是想让其他人陷入与你一样的深渊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>马库斯小姐，您、您也负有不可推卸的责任……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>您没能发现他们存在的纰漏，没能及时地将他们的内容从……从您的作品中剔除出去，才因此造成了读者们的不满、出版社的混乱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>您应该以我的回忆为原型，讲述七圣岛的历史和矮人们的传说……这说不定能引发读者们的热烈讨论，甚、甚至还能从中收获源源不断的创作灵感……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>嚯……原来你只是在吹嘘自己的部分！要我看，里面到处都是乱糟糟的漏洞和不切实际的幻想，根本不能称为完整的记录！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-515502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>仅在这一点上，我十分认同马歇尔的说法。结论显而易见，我的回忆才是最完整的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-515302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>那请问，你又有什么高、高见呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">幽灵众：</div><div>&amp;……*%#@！￥（……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在近乎绝望的目光中，更尖锐的、互不示弱的争执声彻底堵塞了这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯眼前一片灰暗。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>故事，究竟是何以成为事故的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是在那些蜂拥而至的信件们堆积成山的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是在我投出新一篇稿件的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还是在我面对幽灵先生们丰富的故事素材，却迟迟无法选择的时候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我真的适合这份工作吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>当我开始写作时，我希望能够将我所阅读的一切都记录下来……那些不被人们理解的知识，或许，它们不仅仅属于一小撮孤独的世界，也并不沉默寡言……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>它们同样有着设计精巧的一页、细腻的一页，能够令人驻足，令人向往，也能引起共鸣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可……我都做了些什么啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯闭上眼睛，先前的一幕幕无情地掠过她的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们似乎与理想背道而驰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望人类能逐渐理解、接受神秘学……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可我的专栏遭到了读者们的不满与抨击，他们甚至因此闯入了《白日梦邮报》……可怜的丹尼希编辑，她一定没法通过优秀编辑的评选了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>或许……或许读者们再也不会相信任何与神秘学有关的故事了，神秘学有关的作品……不、乃至读者都会被套上故弄玄虚、胡言乱语的罪名……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>甚至人类都会因此对弗兰南群岛，不、对整个神秘学世界都产生更严重的偏见！……而我是致使两个种族隔阂加深的罪人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这全是我的错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯捂着脸，屋内始终持续的嘈杂毫不避讳地窜入了她的耳中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我希望能通过我的阅读，通过记录朋友们的故事令他们摆脱困于岛上的孤独，能被世人所知，能交到更多的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可身为主人公的幽灵先生们因此反目，他们互相攻讦，针锋相对，陷入分裂……我的创作并没有令他们获得半点儿幸福，反而加剧了他们的不幸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可、可我最初只是想讲述一个美好而有趣的故事啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在仅属于自己的一隅里大声疾呼，希望能短暂地掩去周围的喧闹与嘈杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边的争执声似乎真的停下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是我的心理暗示起效了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-515402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>嘿，快醒醒，马库斯——！有人来找你了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在恍惚中回过神来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一抹熟悉而陌生的灰白映入她的眼帘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>我是霍夫曼。很高兴见到你，马库斯小姐。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTL-05"}}